div.p:
Having considered the General Assembly resolution
of the 2nd December, 1950 (document A/1616) on the subject of the Ewe
problem;

Noting that certain groups in the two Trust
Territories declined to take part in certain stages of the elections or in the
proceedings of the enlarged Consultative Commission;

Notes with approval that the Administering
Authorities propose to take steps in order to encourage these groups to take
part hereafter in the work of the Commission;

(Note: The following two paragraphs to
                        be shifted so as to come after, rather than precede, the above paragraph;
                        the “urges” paragraph tobe redrafted as follows:)
